WEBVTT

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:33.850
Translator: Ladholyman
Timer/Typesetter: Maceart
Ending: Huzzah

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:33.850
Presented by Doremi-fansubs
www.doremi-fansubs.com
#doremi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:33.850
This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:37.400
June 15, 1582 - Yamashiro Castle - Chion-in

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.190
Speaking will just exacerbate your wounds, Lord Akechi.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:58.930
I... was tricked...

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.150
by Hashiba.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.260
If you want to create everlasting peace...

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:12.560
Please become strong.

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:24.560
Do not repeat what I did...

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:34.040
Dusk at Yodo River

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:37.340
If this list is true,

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.840
then the moment is ripe for Tokugawa to take over the heavens!

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.310
If Master Rikyū kills the Chief Advisor,

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:45.930
Mōri and many other commanders will follow us!

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:49.030
But we have no reason to attack Toyotomi!

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:51.910
Tokugawa may be aiming for everlasting peace,

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:55.290
but to move without a motive is akin to bringing chaos!

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:59.070
Do you want the Tokugawa clan to die here!?

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:02.670
We have no idea when Toyotomi will take over Edo!

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:05.910
Do you want our lord to become a traitor!?

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.630
If we want to keep Lord Tokugawa's involvement a secret,

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.250
then we must kill the Chief Advisor.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.650
We do not feel at ease relying only on Master Rikyū's daughter.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.900
We have to send someone to help her in secret.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:30.370
Someone who will not leak our plans even when discovered.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:32.560
Such dastardly deeds...

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.400
After the Chief Advisor dies,

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.250
we can expose the truth behind the Honnō-ji Incident.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:41.210
Citizens of the land will come to revere us.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:47.370
That will serve as a fitting end to Toyotomi's illegitimate rule.

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:54.690
Please exact revenge for Lord Akechi's sake!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.600
Please become strong.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:09.920
You cannot make your ideals come true without dirtying your own hands.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:22.820
Hanzō, can you find someone with undying loyalty for me?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.940
At your command, I can name a few elite ninjas from Iga.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:43.460
I can become a traitor for the sake of justice.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:48.440
We must keep this meeting a secret.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:52.220
February 13, 1591 - Kyoto - Sen no Rikyū's Residence

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:02.410
Under the Chief Advisor's orders, you are under house arrest here in Sakai, Sen no Rikyū.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:06.520
Please accompany us down the Yodo River.

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:13.500
He's still not cutting my head off. I'm sure he's in a lot of pain.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:20.820
I've prepared a poem. Please give it to my daughter, Ogin.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:30.900
Please realize from the poem that I want you to terminate the plan.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.640
I do not wish to drag any more people into this.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:37.390
Same Day - Kyoto - Hosokawa Tadaoki's Residence

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:47.850
Where are you going, Tadaoki?

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:51.100
Move aside, Father!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:56.150
I came here right after I heard the verdict.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.920
My powers weren't enough to pardon Master.

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:03.310
I must apologize to him at least!

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:06.980
No! Master Rikyū is a criminal now!

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:09.980
If you go and see him, you will be turning your back on the Toyotomi clan!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:13.800
I cannot let you take individual action that will jeopardize the Hosokawa clan!

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:14.730
No use in telling me!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:31.680
I've gotten old.

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:40.480
Lord Yūsai!

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:46.390
Oh, Sasuke. Can you stop Tadaoki for me?

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:49.140
Is he going to send Master off?

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:52.920
If he gets seen by Toyotomi's men, then he'll be punished.

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:56.080
I'll think of a way to stop him.

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:41.810
Do not take that off!

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:02.360
Such reckless behavior...

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.920
Oh... What a beautiful sunset.

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:22.350
If they find out who we are, we will be severely punished.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.540
The Chief Councilor now is the strict Lord Ishida.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.550
There's nothing to fear.

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:31.660
If he's really going to prevent anyone from sending Master off,

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.190
then I will take up my arms and fight!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.240
With my 6,000 troops!

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:43.630
As Master's closest disciples, we have to work together!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:49.180
All of the daimyo are watching our every move!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.890
I feel the same as you regarding Master.

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:57.420
And because of the Honnō-ji Incident,

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:00.890
the Chief Advisor and Master's relationship has gotten complicated.

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.630
As bystanders, we have no right to interject.

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:09.370
By doing so, we will only repeat the bloodshed.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:12.580
We must find a way to end all of this peacefully...

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:16.770
February 15 - Kyoto - Mōri Terumoto's Residence

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.800
Master Rikyū hasn't sent a letter yet?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.560
No, and his closest disciples have not taken any actions.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:29.390
He doesn't reach out to me, Mōri Terumoto, even after being put under house arrest?

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.470
Unless he is restricted from doing so...

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.920
If he gets sentenced to death after this...

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:42.350
Get 3,000 men ready under the guise of invading China!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:45.770
Same Day - Kyoto - Kuroda Nagamasa's Residence

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:49.130
Why are you preparing 1,000 men?

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:52.010
What is going on, Father?

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:56.600
According to Master Rikyū, things have gotten unpredictable.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:01.040
The Toyotomi clan may split, providing us with a chance to overtake them.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:04.870
Pay close attention to his closest disciples.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:09.280
They may be the ones to strike first.

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:12.810
Same Night - Kyoto - Jurakudai Inner Sanctum

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:24.680
Rikyū has committed many crimes, akin to Kan Shōjō.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:35.010
From these words, he is telling me that his crimes are his alone. There is no need for retaliation.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:40.640
In the end, he will be revered like the late Sugawara no Michizane.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:46.270
But if Father is trying to retire all of his karma at once,

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.490
he is only running away from judgement.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.940
If Michizane is revered as a god,

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:58.410
then I will act as the devil.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:05.420
My life will be in danger after finishing off the Chief Advisor.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:09.570
I will wait in the underworld for you.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:18.810
Carpenters Gohei and Tomekichi?

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.330
All right. You may go inside.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:28.000
It's easy to get in, but getting out alive will be...

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.840
Don't say that now.

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.220
Humans are such annoying creatures.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.400
Once you have dirtied your hands,

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:38.210
you fear for your own safety.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:44.270
No, I must live on with this fear.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:48.320
Everything for my ideals of heavenly peace.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:52.320
Arm every wall so that ninjas cannot climb them.

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:23.720
I understand your feelings, Lord Maeda.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:29.420
If I admit to the Chief Advisor that I was wrong, then I will be pardoned.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:34.350
I refuse this offer.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:55.420
Why... Why must you choose such a severe fate...

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:58.610
Forgive me.

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:14.170
Master, the Igayaki you orderd from Kyoto is here.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.520
What do you think?

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:18.180
Well...

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:22.030
It seems like a failed vase that has been smashed during its creation.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:25.540
Isn't this quite different from your tastes?

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:29.640
I have reached the summit of my imperfection.

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:33.970
But for that imperfection to live on, it must maintain different forms.

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:40.160
One of the ways is through this warped vase.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:56.190
Why do I remember the two of them now?

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:00.740
Goodness, they knew it was quite dangerous to see me off.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.960
Why are you smiling?

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:06.210
I see.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.110
A smile possesses great power.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:14.080
It calms me down, even if I know I am going to die.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:21.260
I may not have achieved what I wanted, but as long as there are people expanding on such beauty...

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:32.680
Let's decorate this with flowers and have some tea.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.140
You're so cute, Tsurumatsu!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.310
Please make a decision, Milord.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:54.060
You have to kill Rikyū before his commanders plot something.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:56.430
You have to put an end to it all.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:59.640
Look at those innocent and pure hands.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.510
So different from Ogin's hands.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:14.750
We've already seized Rikyū's sculpture from Daitoku Temple.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:18.050
Prepare to display it over the Ichijō Modoribashi Bridge.

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:20.770
That will force the Chief Advisor to cut off his head.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:24.380
Tighten the security around the Jurakurai, too.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:27.240
If you see any suspicious activity, be sure to report to me immediately.

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:28.040
All right.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:31.140
Give this message to Lord Uesugi Kagekatsu.

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:39.190
Tell him to have 2,000 of his men patrol the execution grounds to prevent any fishy business.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:42.240
Now the only problem left is who will execute Rikyū.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.130
I recommend Lord Makita Awajima no Kami.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:50.320
Makita? Isn't he one of Rikyū's disciples?

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.610
He has high skill in the martial arts.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.330
As someone who does not approve of Rikyū's crimes,

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.420
he is the perfect candidate.

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:09.100
The rest of the commanders cannot object to our choice and will then retreat.

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:12.910
Milord, Ishida Jibunosho is here to see you.

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:20.640
Madam Ogin, His Majesty is asking for your company tonight.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.230
I will be right there.

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:44.660
Please enter from here.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.700
We aren't passing by the waiting room?

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.190
Please enter from here tonight.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.130
Madam Ochacha.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.420
What business do you have with me?

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:05.190
I'm searching your body.

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:10.070
Things have gotten a bit out of control lately.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:30.820
I will not let you enter his bedroom!

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:36.510
Servants!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:57.950
His Majesty was right. She took her own life...

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:05.760
I won't let anyone kill you. Not until Tsurumatsu grows up a bit more...

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:15.940
What's going on? It's so loud.

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:00.480
Are you all right, Milord?

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:01.640
Who are they!?

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:08.500
Keep them alive! They may have accomplices!

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:30.030
The Chidori tea bowl made a sound that warned me of danger.

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:31.530
Thank goodness you are all right.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.450
You have good karma, Milord.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.350
But things are worse than you thought.

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:42.990
We may have stopped the assassins, but Ogin was one of them.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.640
You cannot wait any longer!

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:54.160
Your enemies have sent assassins to the inner sanctum!

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:57.540
You have to take care of Rikyū, the man behind all of this,

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:00.600
or else you risk the demise of the Toyotomi clan.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:06.370
Please make a decision!

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:20.950
Have Rikyū... commit seppuku.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:26.310
Seppuku is for warriors. I suggest cutting off his head.

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:28.350
Shut up.

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:34.110
What should we do with him?

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:36.010
He has said nothing.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:40.440
Have him boil to death for his crime as a thief.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:43.420
This is for the sake of peace.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.690
You guys did pretty well.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:50.220
Having His Majesty get assaulted first before stopping the assassins must have been quite hard.

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.930
But now he has made a decision.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.920
So what will happen to Master Rikyū?

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:57.600
He ordered him to commit seppuku.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:00.930
Have 3,000 troops surround Rikyū's residence.

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:04.360
Display the sculpture immediately at Ichijō Modoribashi Bridge.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.370
Why didn't you make a sound?

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:29.400
Why does no one love me?

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.780
Don't you dare make a move, Lord Takayama.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:05.120
If you mess this up, Lord Maeda will be in danger.

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:07.460
Are you really going?

00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:12.340
Even if you ask the Chief Advisor directly, Master will still seppuku...

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:18.480
And if they found out you sent him off secretly...

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.920
Master Tadaoki may get punished, too.

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:36.740
Oh God... Please protect my brother.

00:22:38.770 --> 00:22:41.990
Even so, I cannot just sit still.

00:22:43.810 --> 00:22:47.350
For the sake of imperfection to continue its existence.

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:06.210
Everytime I　

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:06.210
Anata no mune

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:08.600
feel your heart

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:08.600
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.690
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.690
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:20.870
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:20.870
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:27.030
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:27.030
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:33.120
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:33.120
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:37.000
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:37.000
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:40.580
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:40.580
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:46.450
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:46.450
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.550 --> 00:23:49.450
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.550 --> 00:23:49.450
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:52.060
Without each other.

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:52.060
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.150 --> 00:23:53.020
You should

00:23:52.150 --> 00:23:53.020
Soshite

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:58.520
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:58.520
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:02.310
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:02.310
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:08.020
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:08.020
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.100 --> 00:24:14.510
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.100 --> 00:24:14.510
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.570 --> 00:24:20.310
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.570 --> 00:24:20.310
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.790 --> 00:24:26.290
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.790 --> 00:24:26.290
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.230 --> 00:24:35.900
All that's left is to die beautifully.

00:24:40.800 --> 00:24:42.590
Don't be a warrior anymore!

00:24:47.420 --> 00:24:48.680
I can't do it!

00:24:49.290 --> 00:24:51.910
Aren't You a Fan of Imperfection?

00:24:52.970 --> 00:24:57.300
To be a warrior or an aesthete? That is the question.

00:24:56.260 --> 00:24:59.550
Aren't You a Fan of Imperfection?
